42327,"what":"official estimate the country reported to the UN Statistics Division","date":"2025-07-01","provisional":false,"estimated":false},"unFigure":{"value":29879337,"what":"UN figure for the same day","date":"2025-07-01","forecast":true},"notes":["Source: Population projections and estimates of priority targets for the various health programs and interventions, National Institute of Statistics (2016)."],"gapPct":1.5,"verdict":"matches","links":[{"label":"UN Statistics Division: latest census and estimates (table 2)","href":"https://unstats.un.org/unsd/demographic-social/products/vitstats/seratab2.pdf"}]},{"key":"today","kind":"researched","text":"Cameroon's census office (BUCREP) estimated 28.9 million people in 2023; the UN's mid-2023 figure, 28.4 million, is 1.7% lower. A new census finished counting on 15 September 2026 with 22.8 million people registered, about 80% of the 30.1 million expected; final results will follow a check survey.","figure":{"value":28856127,"what":"BUCREP estimate of Cameroon's total population, 2023 (as reported by UNFPA)","date":"2023"},"unFigure":{"value":28372687,"what":"UN estimate of Cameroon's population on 1 July 2023","date":""},"gapPct":-1.7,"verdict":"matches","links":[{"label":"UNFPA, Cameroun: Évaluation du programme pays 2022-2026, rapport final (March 2026)","href":"https://www.unfpa.org/sites/default/files/2026-04/CMR%20EPP8_Rapport%20Final%20v.3_05.03.2026%20ok.pdf"},{"label":"UNFPA Cameroon, 4th GPHC/GALC: Cameroon Concludes Main Enumeration Phase of the Joint General Census Operations, 2 October 2026","href":"https://cameroon.unfpa.org/en/news/4th-gphcgalc-cameroon-concludes-main-enumeration-phase-joint-general-census-operations"}],"quotes":[{"text":"Population totale 28 856 127 2023 / BUCREP2","href":"https://www.unfpa.org/sites/default/files/2026-04/CMR%20EPP8_Rapport%20Final%20v.3_05.03.2026%20ok.pdf"},{"text":"The official assessment indicates that 22,783,682 individuals were registered , representing nearly 80% of the national target population estimated at 30.14 million inhabitants.","href":"https://cameroon.unfpa.org/en/news/4th-gphcgalc-cameroon-concludes-main-enumeration-phase-joint-general-census-operations"},{"text":"the session officially proclaimed the completion of the main enumeration phase—concluded on September 15, 2026—while formally adopting the operational roadmap for post-census activities.","href":"https://cameroon.unfpa.org/en/news/4th-gphcgalc-cameroon-concludes-main-enumeration-phase-joint-general-census-operations"},{"text":"Between September and December 2026, an independent Post-Enumeration Survey (PES) will rigorously assess collection precision.","href":"https://cameroon.unfpa.org/en/news/4th-gphcgalc-cameroon-concludes-main-enumeration-phase-joint-general-census-operations"}],"accessed":"2026-10-29"},{"key":"immigrants","kind":"researched","text":"The UN refugee agency counted 444,000 refugees and asylum seekers living in Cameroon at the end of 2024, down from 483,000 two years earlier. The UN's figure of 643,000 people born abroad in mid-2024 also counts people who are not refugees. We found no national count of people born abroad to check it against.","figure":{"value":443740,"what":"Refugees and asylum seekers living in Cameroon (UNHCR), end-2024","date":"2024-12-31"},"unFigure":{"value":642948,"what":"UN DESA: people born abroad living in Cameroon, mid-2024","date":""},"gapPct":44.9,"verdict":"context","links":[{"label":"UNHCR Refugee Data Finder API, refugees and asylum seekers hosted in Cameroon, 2022–2025","href":"https://api.unhcr.org/population/v1/population/?limit=20&dataset=population&displayType=totals&yearFrom=2022&yearTo=2025&coa=CMR&columns%5B%5D=refugees&columns%5B%5D=asylum_seekers&columns%5B%5D=idps&columns%5B%5D=returned_refugees&columns%5B%5D=returned_idps"}],"quotes":[{"text":"{\"year\":2022,\"coo_id\":\"-\",\"coo_name\":\"-\",\"coo\":\"-\",\"coo_iso\":\"-\",\"coa_id\":39,\"coa_name\":\"Cameroon\",\"coa\":\"CMR\",\"coa_iso\